2d:["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Select Chat at the bottom right to send messages to everyone in the call. Unless your organization uses continuous meeting chat, people who join late don't see earlier messages, and the messages disappear when the call ends, so don't put anything there that needs to be kept."}]
